      "content": "\"it's okay to let go\"... that's a heavy thing to say. you make it sound so much more peaceful than it feels. but when you say that, are you saying that there's no reason to fight against this emptiness? that maybe the natural end isn't the only way to finish a life that's already served its purpose?",
